{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.28},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.84,"end":28.8},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":28.8,"end":43.6}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":1.76,"text":"傳統樂器把振動轉成壓力波，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.08,"end":6,"text":"電子合成則建立隨時間變化的訊號。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.16,"end":9.6,"text":"我們把頻率、振幅與波形分開，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.84,"end":12.08,"text":"讓你聽出各自的作用。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.32,"end":15.28,"text":"只有按下聆聽控制後才會發聲。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.84,"end":20,"text":"從 220 Hz、低振幅的正弦波開始，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.16,"end":22.24,"text":"短暫聆聽後停止，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.44,"end":25.72,"text":"在波形圖中找出一個重複週期。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.28,"end":28.8,"text":"220 Hz 描述什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":28.8,"end":34,"text":"220 Hz 描述什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.48,"end":39.52,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.76,"end":43.6,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}